OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after getting into
OL,4,Adifficulty in sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after getting into
OL,7,Fdifficulty in the sea in Guernsey,
OL,8,Fpolice have said.
OL,10,FGuernsey Police said emergency services
OL,11,Fresponded to reports of a person
OL,12,Fshouting for help in the water at
OL,13,FHavelet Bay on Monday evening.
OL,15,FThe force said 40-year-old Razibul
OL,16,FHasan was given CPR but he died at the
OL,17,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
