OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after getting into
OL,4,Adifficulty in sea
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Officers have been closely liaising
OL,7,Fwith Hasan's family since this
OL,8,Fincident, and we would like to express
OL,9,Four condolences with them at this
OL,10,Fdifficult and tragic time," the force
OL,11,Fsaid.
